# ----------------------------
# Media / large test assets
# ----------------------------
# Keep test captures out of Git by default.
*.mov
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.avi
*.webm

# Uncomment specific media files with !path/to/file if one is deliberately
# small and should be version-controlled.

